1. DEFINITIONS

   "Software" means the WUXICODE source tree, the `wx` Python package, the
   `_wx_core` compiled extension, the WUXICODE license server, and any
   distribution or build thereof produced by the Licensor.

   "Licensor" means ujin, the copyright holder and licensor of the Software.

   "You" means the individual or legal entity exercising the rights granted by
   this License.

   "Authorized Use" means use of the Software strictly within the scope of the
   entitlement tier You hold, as published in docs/LICENSE-PLAN.md and enforced
   by the license server.

   "Tier" means WX (Free), WX PLUS, or WX ZEN, each granting the entitlements
   defined for that tier.


2. GRANT OF LICENSE

   Subject to Your compliance with this License and payment of any applicable
   fees, the Licensor grants You a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable,
   non-sublicensable, revocable license to install and execute the Software on
   any number of devices You personally control, solely for Your Authorized
   Use. Rights are granted by Tier as follows.

   2.1  WX (Free) — individual use only. Personal and non-commercial. No license
        key is issued or required. A single individual at a time.

   2.2  WX PLUS — individual use, commercial permitted. Commercial and
        production use are granted. Seats are limited to one (1) individual.

   2.3  WX ZEN — team use, commercial permitted. Commercial and production use
        are granted to a team of up to five (5) individuals.

   2.4  WX ULTIMATE — API access, commercial permitted. Commercial and
        production use are granted to a team of up to ten (10) individuals.
        In addition to the CLI entitlements of every other Tier, this Tier
        grants:
          (a) issuance of API keys for programmatic access to the Software's
              model endpoints;
          (b) integration of those API keys into external applications and
              services You own or operate;
          (c) priority support, and concurrent request and token ceilings as
              published in docs/LICENSE-PLAN.md.

   WX ULTIMATE is billed on prepaid credit, not by subscription. The purchase
   price credits a fixed quantity of tokens to Your account. Credits are drawn
   down as the Software consumes model output. When the remaining balance
   reaches zero, access stops until the account is recharged. Optional
   auto-recharge, if enabled by You, debits the payment method on file at the
   rate published at purchase. Unused credits do not roll over past the
   recharge term stated on the purchase.

   No other rights are granted. All rights not expressly granted herein are
   reserved by the Licensor. In particular, no Tier grants the right to
   distribute, sublicense, or make the Software available to a party outside
   the seat limit stated above.


3. RESTRICTIONS

   You may not:

   (a) publish, mirror, redistribute, sublicense, rent, lease, or otherwise make
       the Software available to any third party, in source or binary form;

   (b) remove, alter, or obscure any copyright notice, license notice, or
       entitlement watermark in the Software or its output;

   (c) copy the Software into a derived product, service, or platform you
       distribute or make commercially available;

   (d) use the license server, activation endpoints, or signed entitlement
       tokens except as the Software uses them, or attempt to forge, mint, or
       tamper with entitlement tokens or license checks;

   (e) circumvent, disable, or interfere with tier gating, token accounting, or
       concurrency limits;

   (f) use a single license key for more than one individual or concurrent
       session, beyond the `max_concurrent` entitlement of Your Tier, or seat
       Your account beyond the seat limit stated in Section 2;

   (g) with an API key issued under Section 2.4: embed the key in any product,
       application, or service that You distribute or make available to third
       parties; publish the key; or use it outside the rate, concurrency, and
       token ceilings of your Tier;

   (h) resell, sublicense, or meter API access obtained under Section 2.4 as a
       standalone offering, whether free or paid, without a separate written
       agreement with the Licensor.

   Reverse engineering is permitted only to the limited extent that applicable
   law (including mandatory local law permitting such reverse engineering for
   interoperability or debugging) expressly permits it notwithstanding this
   section.


4. ENTITLEMENTS AND TIER SCOPE

   Tier definitions, token limits, model access, tool permissions, API access
   rights, billing mode, and concurrency limits are specified in
   docs/LICENSE-PLAN.md, which is the authoritative commercial description of
   this Software, and in the tier definitions shipped with the license server.

   The Software verifies Your entitlement online. The Licensor may adjust tier
   terms prospectively as announced in the release notes. Adjustments do not
   apply retroactively to a paid term already paid for.

   Network failure, server outage, or license revocation suspends paid
   entitlements until the condition is resolved. Free-tier functionality does not
   require network access to remain functional.


5. TERM AND TERMINATION

   This License is effective from the date You first run the Software and
   continues until terminated.

   This License terminates automatically and without notice upon any breach of
   Section 3, or upon the expiry of the paid term for the applicable Tier. For
   WX ULTIMATE, the paid term is the credit balance: depletion of the balance
   suspends API access under Section 2.4 but does not by itself terminate this
   License, which resumes on recharge.

   Upon termination You must cease all use of the Software and delete all copies
   in your possession or control. Accrued fees are non-refundable except where
   mandatory law provides otherwise.


